  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insats avser sekondering av svensk expert till State Prosecutor i Bosnien-Hercegovina. Sekonderingen uppg&#xe5;r till 12 m&#xe5;nader och huvudsakliga arbetsuppgifter avser &#xe5;talshantering av lokala  krigsf&#xf6;rbrytelser.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Secondment of a Swedish expert to State Prosecutor in  Bosnia-Herzegovina. The secondment is for 12 months, and the expert will work as prosecutor at the Special Organised Crime, Economic Crime and Corruption Unit. The tasks will above all include handling of war crime investigations.</narrative>
  </description>
